		{
			dependencies: ["7B99DC38DC39F93A"]
			description: [
				"For later. The &6ME Stocking Input Bus&r (IV) lets a multiblock see what the network holds and take it only when a recipe runs."
				"The &6ME Pattern Buffer&r (LuV) puts a whole pattern provider inside the machine, and buffer proxies share it with other machines."
